//  Peculiarities :

      //  Timer :

            //  Timer  used  to  have  a  VB  Timer  as  a  base ,
            //  and  an  interface  implementation  for  it .

      //  Events :

            //  Basically  you  are  missing  events  in  Creator.  I  will  implement
            //  a  preliminary  solution,  using  the  event  interface  principle,
            //  which  can  provide  me  with  single  cast  events.

            //  Events  are  implemented  as  single  cast  event  interfaces
                  //  So  every  event  client  has  an  object  in  it
                  //  That  is  the  event  sink.  The  objects  is  of  a  new  class
                  //  That  contains  all  the  members  in  the  event  interface,
                  //  And  implements  a  custom  procedure  for  it.
                  //  This  object  is  assigned  to  the  sub  object's  
                  //  event  sink  object.

      //  Method  Parameters :

            //  Also  denote  in  documentation  that  you  used  attributes  to  provide  event  parameters

